│ The core problem is that Django 3.0 changed how it handles primary │
│ keys when saving model instances with explicit primary keys. In    │
│ Django 2.2 and earlier, it would perform an INSERT followed by an  │
│ UPDATE. In Django 3.0, it performs two INSERT operations, which    │
