│  [/patched]                                                        │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This patch modifies the save method to ensure that when a primary  │
│ key is provided, a single INSERT followed by an UPDATE is          │
│ performed, aligning with the desired backwards-compatible          │
│ behavior. The second modification to loaddata.py does not require  │
│ any changes, as the existing logic already handles the case where  │
│ a primary key is not provided.                                     │
